&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Cobalah dan periksa jawaban Anda denganhttps://github.com/cheroliv/cheroliv.com/blob/master/codes/src/test/kotlin/functional/DeclarativeTests.kt[solusi, windows=&quot;_blank].&lt;/p&gt;
